    not an orange effect behind a hue filter. No noisy bright field outside fuel.
  Calmer coherent advection, fewer glints and blue light replace harsh orange
    grain and brown active logs; the extinguished zero campfire stays cold.
  Calendar, mission card and Streaks hero use the same refined artwork and
    consistent theme-aware blue accents, without larger or rounder UI chrome.
  Actual streak counts/history, header dimensions, legible date/text and raised
    red weekend strip remain. No data/schema/default/reward/clock changes.
